I think it makes sense that pets can get paralyzed by floating eyes.  It
doesn't make sense otherwise.  Fluffy has eyes too, you know.  I've
never had problems with floating eyes, except when I get careless.  Just
stand back and lob stuff...even rocks will do.

>  * First level.  Certainly not a bones level.  Almost finished mapping the
