>      The goblin zaps a wand!  --more--
>      You die...  --more--
>  
>    Aaagh!  What's a frenning death ray wand doing on the first level?  Such
>    powerful weaponry simply shouldn't exist on the first level, at least
>    not just lying around (I can see getting it with a wish...)  I firmly
>    believe that every character should have a chance, no matter how slim,
