I think that's just the breaks.  This should be very rare, actually. 
The 3.0j spoilers claimed that wands of death were generated randomly as
often as wands of wishing.  Although it seems wands of death are now
more common (but can't confirm it), if you're going to limit the bad
stuff, you should limit the good stuff.  Just as you shouldn't find
wands of death, you shouldn't find wands of wishing.  No wands of
lightning, no magic lamps.  No...I certainly don't want to see that
happen.  Just grin and bear the ugly little deaths...it was just a first
level character anyway.

